#: views/b2s/settings.php:332
msgid "Tired of generic WordPress links like 'yourwebsite.com/?p=123'? With Blog2Social's Pro and Business versions, you can transform them into engaging, personalized URLs like 'yourwebsite.com/[blog-post-name]'."
msgstr "Hast Du genug von generischen WordPress Links wie \"deinewebseite.com/?p=123\"? Verwandle sie in ansprechende, individuelle URLs mit Blog2Social Pro oder Business."

